    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain proficiency in one skill of your choice.</p><p>In addition, you can glimpse your past to help you in the present: when you fail an ability check, you can roll 1d6 and add the number rolled to the d20, possibly turning the failure into a success. You can do this a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
